name:  Camp Grounds
theme: camp
notes: Larger camp. South edge = emerge from the (off-map) summoning room; main street -> big fenced sparring arena (3 enemy entrances N/E/W + S approach); deep ragged forest on top (raid source); big tent placeholders + open yards.
